{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10356","headline":"赠别沈四逸人 · 高适","name":"赠别沈四逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈侯未可测，其况信浮沈。\n十载常独坐，几人知此心。\n乘舟蹈沧海，买劒投黄金。\n世务不足烦，有田西山岑。\n我来遇知己，遂得开清襟。\n何意阃阈间，沛然江海深。\n疾风扫秋树，濮上多鸣砧。\n耿耿尊酒前，联雁飞愁音。\n平生重离别，感激对孤琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}